This is CareerOS — an AI-powered career operating system.

Tech stack: Python 3.11, FastAPI, SQLAlchemy 2.0 async, PostgreSQL,
Pydantic v2, Alembic, local GGUF inference via app/ai/.

Key architectural rules that always apply:
- Never make synchronous database calls
- Never hardcode API keys — use environment variables via core/config.py
- All model inference lives in app/ai/ behind the local adapter
- Do not call hosted LLM or embedding APIs from CareerOS runtime
- Missing local weights must fail closed with a clear error; never fall back to a cloud provider

Current development phase: MVP (Phase 1)
Active focus: local inference adapter + FastAPI + PostgreSQL models
